{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-03T16:39:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084318148078059719"],"id":"2084318148078059719","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":6922,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我们必须想象kiri是幸福的","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2084318148078059719"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-03T14:51:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084291162248986697"],"id":"2084291162248986697","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":8537,"like_count":51,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":13,"retweet_count":4},"text":"所有细碎都软烂在雨夜黏腻的一切里。\n我在爱人干燥指掌间写下我爱你，便彻底困在他的手心。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2084291162248986697"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-03T10:13:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084221000074338738"],"id":"2084221000074338738","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":19088,"like_count":72,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":62,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我想了一下这个账号应该不会再更新前夫回忆录了，我已经放下了，大家有缘再见","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2084221000074338738"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-03T10:12:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084220741566845287"],"id":"2084220741566845287","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5796,"like_count":20,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我的前十八年人生告诉我坏人和啥必都是不分性别的，因而我从来不美化任何群体，男人、女人、同担、同人女，我的真挚只给我认为值得的人，我的善意也只给对我散发善意的人。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2084220741566845287"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-03T10:09:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084220002723418286"],"id":"2084220002723418286","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7747,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":26,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我要一颗直径5000公里，速度300000公里／秒的陨石撞击地球","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2084220002723418286"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-03T10:05:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084219104299221422"],"id":"2084219104299221422","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":10417,"like_count":168,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":27},"text":"即使知道分离是我们所有人此生的命运，也难免希望相伴的日子能长一些。我知道，你有时会害怕这个世界，它的狂乱、陌生和不可理喻会刺痛你。那么我希望，你不要用那么硬的东西、不要用会伤害自己的东西去阻隔世界。我可以做隔着你和这个世界的小毯子。害怕的时候，就把心裹在这张小毯子里。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2084219104299221422"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-03T09:58:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084217273938543056"],"id":"2084217273938543056","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8421,"like_count":55,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":5},"text":"人还是得多出去走走才知道还是躺在家吹空调最舒服","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2084217273938543056"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-03T01:11:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084084765263618111"],"id":"2084084765263618111","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":212,"impression_count":661564,"like_count":5453,"quote_count":70,"reply_count":658,"retweet_count":356},"text":"想象一下我是你的女儿每天睡到中午才醒然后一直待在房间里玩电脑玩手机玩到凌晨三四点多才睡觉","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2084084765263618111"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-02T17:27:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083967917230583864"],"id":"2083967917230583864","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5033,"like_count":26,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"她落下的泪珠子织成一串珍珠项链，半隐于空，是此生唯一的奢侈品。于是她又高兴地哭泣，宁肯要这摇摇欲坠的华丽。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083967917230583864"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-02T17:23:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083966878582489290"],"id":"2083966878582489290","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":5157,"like_count":40,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":5},"text":"想起你的好让我想掉眼泪","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083966878582489290"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-02T17:04:03.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083962040599880056"],"id":"2083962040599880056","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":11953,"like_count":95,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":54,"retweet_count":10},"text":"我越到晚上，我说话越傻逼，我每天都觉得自己非常傻逼，但是我只能这样，因为我发不出来更聪明的内容","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083962040599880056"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-02T16:43:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083956814547464433"],"id":"2083956814547464433","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3970,"like_count":22,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":3},"text":"有事干的时候焦虑 没事干的时候抑郁","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083956814547464433"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-02T16:38:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083955683142295718"],"id":"2083955683142295718","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4877,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":3},"text":"感觉才华过分厉害的人多多少少都会有一点精神问题，感觉像一种天赐的不完满，而我是纯粹精神问题不带一点才华，感觉是天谴","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083955683142295718"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-02T16:35:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083954873926853106"],"id":"2083954873926853106","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":40,"impression_count":23983,"like_count":533,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":53,"retweet_count":105},"text":"和人相处像是在织围巾，总想织得更长一点，更密一点，更暖和一点，如果我们的关系能一直纠缠不休就好了。如果我们能永远在一起就好了。但事实上我钩织的技术很烂很烂。也不会有人一年四季都要戴围巾。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083954873926853106"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-02T03:03:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083750585325719895"],"id":"2083750585325719895","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4724,"like_count":32,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":5},"text":"好♪想♪有♪一♪大♪笔♪钱♪降♪临♪我♪的♪生♪活♪呀♪\n钱♪钱♪钱♪ 好想有好多钱♪\n钱♪钱♪钱♪ 我想要好多钱♪\n钱钱♪我想你了♪你在哪里呀♪","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083750585325719895"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-01T18:59:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083628639279788256"],"id":"2083628639279788256","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":5007,"like_count":21,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":0},"text":"有时候连轴转的时候会突然想要放弃努力，，我这辈子最大的愿望不过是冬天里窝在185白皮大扔扔粗腿白袜卷毛狗狗眼内向眼镜男怀里打游戏","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083628639279788256"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-01T14:30:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083560952369389742"],"id":"2083560952369389742","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":5778,"like_count":46,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":20,"retweet_count":2},"text":"写那么多东西到底是要给谁看的呢，我不知道，没有一个具体的怀念对象，非要说出来一个人的话那应该是我自己吧，没有人比我更了解我自己了，虽然我也不太了解她","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083560952369389742"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-01T14:29:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083560770328220034"],"id":"2083560770328220034","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4889,"like_count":43,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":2},"text":"跟所有的人保持距离的联系其实很爽，可以肆无忌惮的说一些难听的话，压根不需要在意对方的情绪。对喜欢的人的话就不行了，要装模作样的加上语气词，要思虑三次以上这段话到底合不合适，随时随地不分场合的就撒娇打滚。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083560770328220034"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-08-01T14:28:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083560407332184445"],"id":"2083560407332184445","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6813,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":0},"text":"支持点菜！ https://t.co/EDUqBWYbqm","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2083560407332184445"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2084318148078059719","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juewgx91kzjedw2it44t2ehlkudzst","oldest_id":"2083560407332184445","result_count":19}}